[
  {
    "timestamp": "0:00",
    "content": "Selling auto-renewable subscriptions on the App Store can be rewarding."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "0:11",
    "content": "It can also be challenging to reach customers at critical moments,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "0:14",
    "content": "such as when they're considering canceling a subscription."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "0:17",
    "content": "That moment is an ideal time to remind your customers"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "0:21",
    "content": "of the value they'll receive from your subscription service."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "0:24",
    "content": "I'm Tori, an engineer on the App Store server team,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "0:27",
    "content": "and in this video, I'll share how you can retain subscribers"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "0:31",
    "content": "with Retention Messaging in App Store Connect,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "0:34",
    "content": "a new feature built to help you connect with your customers."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "0:38",
    "content": "First, I'll share an overview of Retention Messaging"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "0:40",
    "content": "and how to set it up in App Store Connect."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "0:44",
    "content": "Then I'll discuss how real-time Retention Messaging"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "0:47",
    "content": "works alongside Retention Messaging in App Store Connect."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "0:50",
    "content": "Here in my exercise app is an example of a customer"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "0:53",
    "content": "canceling an active subscription."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "0:55",
    "content": "The cancellation page displays messaging to the customer"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "0:59",
    "content": "with the impact of canceling."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "1:01",
    "content": "For this subscription, the App Store informs the customer"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "1:04",
    "content": "that their family will no longer have access to this subscription"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "1:07",
    "content": "if they proceed with the cancellation."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "1:10",
    "content": "Here is an opportunity to provide messaging or offers to the customer."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "1:15",
    "content": "Retention Messaging enables you to do just that."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "1:19",
    "content": "Retention Messaging helps you add value to the cancellation flow"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "1:22",
    "content": "by showing a compelling value proposition message to your customers"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "1:26",
    "content": "when they're considering canceling their subscription."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "1:29",
    "content": "You can use Retention Messaging to remind customers"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "1:32",
    "content": "of the benefits of your subscription"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "1:34",
    "content": "or provide them an offer to entice them to remain subscribed."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "1:39",
    "content": "Retention Messaging supports three different views,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "1:42",
    "content": "a message only, a message and an image,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "1:44",
    "content": "or a message and an offer."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "1:45",
    "content": "You can see what these three different views look like with my exercise app."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "1:51",
    "content": "Here, the message is prominently displayed to the customer."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "1:54",
    "content": "I can add an image to add some visual appeal"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "1:57",
    "content": "or I can offer the customer three months free"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "2:00",
    "content": "for their current subscription, Yoga Plus,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "2:03",
    "content": "to provide an extra incentive to stay subscribed."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "2:07",
    "content": "Savory is the percent of subscribers who keep their subscription"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "2:09",
    "content": "after reaching the cancel confirmation page and manage subscriptions."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "2:14",
    "content": "Subscriptions that have adopted Retention Messaging"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "2:17",
    "content": "experience an average save rate increase of plus 1.4 points"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "2:21",
    "content": "equivalent to an 82% increase"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "2:24",
    "content": "with promotional offer messages"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "2:26",
    "content": "achieving the highest observed save rate"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "2:28",
    "content": "at plus 5.5 points equivalent to a 223% increase."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "2:34",
    "content": "Note that we have observed varying results across developers."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "2:37",
    "content": "I'll show you how to set up Retention Messaging in App Store Connect."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "2:42",
    "content": "With Retention Messaging in App Store Connect,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "2:45",
    "content": "you can configure retention messages for your app,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "2:48",
    "content": "which you can map to any of your subscriptions."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "2:51",
    "content": "You can select an image to provide alongside a message from Asset Library."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "2:55",
    "content": "You can configure retention offers to provide to your customer alongside a message."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "3:00",
    "content": "And App Store Connect API will also support retention messaging,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "3:04",
    "content": "allowing you to set up retention messages and retention offers through the API."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "3:10",
    "content": "To learn more about Asset Library,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "3:12",
    "content": "check out the session,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "3:14",
    "content": "Enhance Your Presence on the App Store from WWDC26."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "3:18",
    "content": "Let's review how this works."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "3:21",
    "content": "In App Store Connect, on the subscriptions page,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "3:23",
    "content": "a new area prompts me to get started with retention messaging."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "3:26",
    "content": "When I tap the Get Started button,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "3:30",
    "content": "a modal appears for me to name the retention message."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "3:33",
    "content": "This message is for my yoga subscriptions,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "3:36",
    "content": "so I'll call this Yoga Message,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "3:38",
    "content": "then tap the Create button."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "3:41",
    "content": "A new view shows where I can edit the message text,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "3:44",
    "content": "the image, and applicable subscriptions and offers on the left."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "3:48",
    "content": "On the right is a live preview of my retention message,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "3:51",
    "content": "which updates as I edit."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "3:52",
    "content": "A retention message must always contain message text,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "3:57",
    "content": "but the image and offer are both optional."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "4:00",
    "content": "I'll continue creating a retention message for the Yoga Plus subscription,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "4:04",
    "content": "starting with the text."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "4:05",
    "content": "I'll create a message in English,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "4:07",
    "content": "but you can select other localizations as well."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "4:11",
    "content": "I'll type Launching Next Month Guided Yoga into the text box."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "4:15",
    "content": "Wow, the preview updated right away with the title."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "4:19",
    "content": "I'll keep going and add a description."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "4:21",
    "content": "Don't miss out on guided yoga classes,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "4:24",
    "content": "new metrics targeted for yoga, and more."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "4:27",
    "content": "Again, notice how the preview on the right immediately updates."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "4:31",
    "content": "Now I want to see how this looks with an image."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "4:34",
    "content": "I already have an image in my asset library, so I'll choose that."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "4:38",
    "content": "Our preview is looking really good now."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "4:42",
    "content": "Now I need to select the Yoga Plus subscription"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "4:44",
    "content": "so that all my customers with the Yoga Plus subscription see this message."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "4:48",
    "content": "The Yoga Plus subscription is selected now."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "4:50",
    "content": "You can also select other subscriptions"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "4:53",
    "content": "as a retention message can be associated with many subscriptions."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "4:57",
    "content": "Finally, I want to add some offer options for my eligible customers."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "5:02",
    "content": "I have some retention offers already set up, so I'll select those."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "5:06",
    "content": "Here are all the offers that could appear with this message"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "5:08",
    "content": "along with their eligibility and availability."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "5:10",
    "content": "The App Store will automatically choose the best offer for eligible customers,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "5:16",
    "content": "so you can select multiple offers for a single subscription with confidence."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "5:20",
    "content": "It's also important to note that when the customer is eligible for an offer,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "5:25",
    "content": "the image will be replaced by an offer."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "5:27",
    "content": "If you want to see how other offers appear,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "5:31",
    "content": "you can select a different offer from the offer drop-down."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "5:34",
    "content": "You can also select no offer from the drop-down"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "5:36",
    "content": "to see what the preview looks like without an offer."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "5:39",
    "content": "Let's pivot to testing."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "5:41",
    "content": "Testing in Sandbox verifies your subscription implementation"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "5:44",
    "content": "before proceeding to production."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "5:47",
    "content": "I'm happy to share that retention messages are fully testable in Sandbox."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "5:52",
    "content": "You can test retention messages when canceling your subscription in Sandbox."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "5:57",
    "content": "If you configured a retention offer,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "6:00",
    "content": "you can also verify offer-related fields are properly configured"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "6:03",
    "content": "in the signed transaction or renewal info."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "6:07",
    "content": "We are also introducing retention offers,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "6:10",
    "content": "a new offer type for retention messages."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "6:12",
    "content": "The signed transaction and renewal info are updated"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "6:16",
    "content": "with a new offer type value of 5 to indicate a retention offer was redeemed."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "6:21",
    "content": "Other offer-related fields such as offer identifier,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "6:24",
    "content": "offer discount type, and offer period will also appear as expected."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "6:29",
    "content": "By setting up retention messaging in App Store Connect,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "6:31",
    "content": "you're taking a significant step toward retaining your subscribers"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "6:34",
    "content": "at a critical moment in the subscription lifecycle."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "6:38",
    "content": "If you want to more directly interact with your customer"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "6:40",
    "content": "when they're about to cancel their subscription,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "6:43",
    "content": "you can take this one step further with real-time retention messaging."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "6:47",
    "content": "With real-time retention messaging,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "6:50",
    "content": "you set up an endpoint to provide a real-time message preference"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "6:53",
    "content": "in response to a server-to-server HTTP request from the App Store."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "6:58",
    "content": "With the retention messaging API,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "7:01",
    "content": "you can configure message and image pairs"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "7:03",
    "content": "to show to customers in the cancellation flow."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "7:06",
    "content": "When you receive a real-time call from the App Store,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "7:09",
    "content": "you can tell the App Store which of these messages"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "7:11",
    "content": "you want to show to the customer,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "7:14",
    "content": "or when retention messaging in App Store Connect is configured,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "7:17",
    "content": "you can also indicate one of the messages"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "7:19",
    "content": "from App Store Connect as your preference."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "7:23",
    "content": "I can create the same views for the Yoga Plus subscription"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "7:26",
    "content": "using real-time retention messaging"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "7:28",
    "content": "as I can when using retention messages in App Store Connect."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "7:31",
    "content": "However, real-time retention messaging"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "7:35",
    "content": "also supports a message with a switch plan format,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "7:38",
    "content": "so you can offer your customer a different plan"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "7:40",
    "content": "within the same subscription group"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "7:42",
    "content": "as an alternative to canceling."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "7:44",
    "content": "For the Yoga Plus subscription,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "7:46",
    "content": "I chose to offer an annual subscription as a switch plan."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "7:51",
    "content": "Real-time retention messaging"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "7:52",
    "content": "is powered by the Retention Messaging API,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "7:55",
    "content": "a server-to-server-driven set of endpoints"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "7:57",
    "content": "for managing your messages and images."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "7:59",
    "content": "Using the Retention Messaging API"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "8:02",
    "content": "in both Sandbox and Production,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "8:04",
    "content": "I can configure the URL for the Exercise Apps endpoint,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "8:08",
    "content": "set up messages for the Exercise App,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "8:11",
    "content": "choose default messages for each subscription"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "8:13",
    "content": "in the Exercise App,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "8:15",
    "content": "and upload and manage the Exercise Apps images."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "8:19",
    "content": "In the Sandbox environment only,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "8:21",
    "content": "the Retention Messaging API supports performance testing"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "8:24",
    "content": "and provides endpoints to initiate a performance test"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "8:27",
    "content": "and check your results."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "8:29",
    "content": "Passing a performance test is required"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "8:31",
    "content": "before using real-time retention messaging in production."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "8:35",
    "content": "When the App Store sends a request"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "8:37",
    "content": "for real-time retention messaging,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "8:39",
    "content": "we will send the original transaction ID"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "8:41",
    "content": "to help identify the subscription,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "8:43",
    "content": "the customer's locale"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "8:44",
    "content": "to identify the desired localization,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "8:47",
    "content": "plus a request identifier for tracking,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "8:49",
    "content": "as well as other information."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "8:51",
    "content": "When responding to a real-time request,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "8:54",
    "content": "you can choose one of three response formats."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "8:57",
    "content": "Respond with a message to show a message"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "9:00",
    "content": "or message with an image"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "9:01",
    "content": "by providing a message identifier."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "9:03",
    "content": "I chose a message identifier"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "9:05",
    "content": "that indicates a message about my yoga subscription"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "9:08",
    "content": "that is paired with a corresponding image."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "9:11",
    "content": "Respond with an alternate product"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "9:13",
    "content": "to offer the customer a switch plan"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "9:15",
    "content": "in the same subscription group"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "9:16",
    "content": "by providing a message identifier and a product ID."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "9:20",
    "content": "I chose to offer an annual tier of Yoga Plus"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "9:23",
    "content": "as a switch plan."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "9:25",
    "content": "Or respond with a promotional offer"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "9:27",
    "content": "to give the customer an offer"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "9:28",
    "content": "by providing a message identifier"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "9:30",
    "content": "and promotional offer signature."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "9:33",
    "content": "I chose to provide my promotional offer"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "9:35",
    "content": "for three months free of Yoga Plus."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "9:38",
    "content": "More information on what to provide"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "9:40",
    "content": "in each of these scenarios,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "9:42",
    "content": "other supported scenarios,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "9:43",
    "content": "and the rest of the API"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "9:44",
    "content": "can be found in our documentation"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "9:46",
    "content": "linked in this session's resources."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "9:50",
    "content": "Real-time retention messaging"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "9:51",
    "content": "requires a fast, responsive server."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "9:54",
    "content": "To ensure a great customer experience,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "9:56",
    "content": "you'll need to pass a performance test in Sandbox"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "9:59",
    "content": "before going live to production."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:01",
    "content": "That said,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:02",
    "content": "your server may not always respond in time."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:05",
    "content": "If it doesn't,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:06",
    "content": "the App Store will display"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:07",
    "content": "fallback messaging to the customer."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:10",
    "content": "Real-time retention messaging"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:11",
    "content": "always prioritizes your real-time response."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:14",
    "content": "If that's unavailable or malformed,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:16",
    "content": "the App Store will first fall back"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:18",
    "content": "to your App Store Connect"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:19",
    "content": "retention messaging preference,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:21",
    "content": "including any eligible offers."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:23",
    "content": "If App Store Connect messaging"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:25",
    "content": "is not configured for your subscription,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:27",
    "content": "the App Store will then fall back"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:29",
    "content": "to default messaging"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:30",
    "content": "configured with the retention messaging API."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:33",
    "content": "Get started in Sandbox"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:34",
    "content": "for setting up real-time retention messaging."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:37",
    "content": "First, set up all your test messages"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:39",
    "content": "and images in Sandbox."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:41",
    "content": "When that is completed,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:43",
    "content": "set up your endpoint"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:43",
    "content": "to begin receiving requests"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:45",
    "content": "when a tester tries"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:46",
    "content": "to cancel their subscription."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:49",
    "content": "After you are satisfied"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:50",
    "content": "with your testing in Sandbox,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:51",
    "content": "start a performance test."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:54",
    "content": "When your performance test passes,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:56",
    "content": "then set up messages"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:57",
    "content": "and images in production,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:59",
    "content": "followed by your production endpoint."
  },
  {
